༬༯༱༚་༭ༀ༡༥༔༸</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1342.67,"y":206.86,"cell":683,"i":56,"name":"Holcesbury Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc20\udc0d\udc1f\udc03\udc1b\udc2e𐠪\udc29\ud802𐠌\udc13𐠵\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠮\udc10\ud802𐠟\ud802𐠟𐠝\udc12\udc27\udc20\udc16\udc22\udc33𐠲\udc22\udc29\udc0d\ud802𐠌\udc14\udc27\udc0a\udc20𐠥\ud802 </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":502.45,"y":789.74,"cell":5950,"i":57,"name":"Laundon Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡮᡝᡱᡖᠾᡯᡠᠯᢀᡙ᠐ᠲᡏᡟᠰᡑᢡᠿᢟᠿᠡᡰᡑᢂᢁᡏᡗᢟᡔᠠᠱᢤᢤ᠐ᠲᢏᠵᠲᡠᡔᢐᡐᠽ᠐ᠠᢤᢥᡞᢤᡮᢑᡀᢦᢜᢦᢑᢓᠽᢋᡝᠾ᠐ᡞᠦ᠀ᡮᢥᢛᡏᠱᡍᠽᡕᡟᡱᢥᡆᡯᡝᡑᡯᡟᢀᢂᡆᡰᡏ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1572.44,"y":463.77,"cell":3233,"i":58,"name":"Ruined Fortification","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":556.77,"y":316.98,"cell":1650,"i":59,"name":"Ruined Outpost","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":400.24,"y":377.02,"cell":2311,"i":60,"name":"Ruined Temple","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1529.01,"y":625.29,"cell":4881,"i":61,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":1000.83,"y":259.25,"cell":1142,"i":62,"name":"Waton Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":918.92,"y":239.38,"cell":887,"i":63,"name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":635.94,"y":697.83,"cell":5425,"i":64,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1402.1,"y":618.07,"cell":4743,"i":65,"name":"Ormstontef Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Ormstontef, offering local arms alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":335.5,"y":408.59,"cell":2585,"i":66,"name":"Apseara Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Duria on the road from Kirming. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":463,"y":484.8,"cell":3291,"i":67,"name":"Oakhampton Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Kirming on the road from Thaxtedia. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":686.53,"y":656.31,"cell":5139,"i":68,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Cudgexe River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1401.9,"y":774.2,"cell":5851,"i":69,"name":"Cranes migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of cranes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":392.13,"y":330.72,"cell":1777,"i":70,"name":"Malworth Fracture","tags":[],"note":"The Malworth Fracture. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":418.02,"y":297.84,"cell":1502,"i":71,"name":"Ormstonter Crypt","tags":[],"note":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its de